  "setup": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "players start",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_points"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "discards",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "protected",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "eliminated",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "table starts",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "card_names",
            "value": [
              "none",
              "Guard",
              "Priest",
              "Baron",
              "Handmaid",
              "Prince",
              "King",
              "Countess",
              "Princess"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "starter_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_starter_seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "active_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_starter_seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round_number",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "new_hand",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stake",
            "value": {
              "calc": "base_stake"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "label": "no deal yet",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "No cards are dealt yet. The first hand is dealt at the start of round 1, and seat {starter_seat} starts it."
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "new hand",
      "when": {
        "calc": "new_hand == 1"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "discards",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "out_of_play",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "shuffle",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sorted([[uniform(0, 1000000), c] for c in full_deck])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "full_deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p[1] for p in shuffle]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "out_of_play",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p[1] for p in shuffle if p[0] < shuffle[cards_out_of_play][0]]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[shuffle[cards_out_of_play + you.seat - 1][1]]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "reserve",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[shuffle[deck_size - 1][1]]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p[1] for p in shuffle if p[0] > shuffle[cards_out_of_play + len(players) * cards_dealt_each - 1][0] and p[0] < shuffle[deck_size - 1][0]]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(deck) + len(reserve)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "protected",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "eliminated",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "players": "all",
            "to": "playing"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stake",
            "value": {
              "calc": "base_stake"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "folded",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "active_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starter_seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "new_hand",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "A new hand begins. Seat {active_seat} starts; the stake is {stake}. Set aside face up (out of play): {out_of_play}. Cards in the deck: {deck_count}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "turn",
      "label": "start of turn",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "guard_guess",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "raised",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "prince_target",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "protected",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(deck) + len(reserve)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
            },
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[countess_rank] if (countess_rank in you.hand and (king_rank in you.hand or prince_rank in you.hand)) else ([you.hand[0]] if you.hand[0] == you.hand[1] else you.hand)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Round {round_number}: seat {active_seat} draws a card. Cards left in the deck: {deck_count}."
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "turn",
      "label": "your hand",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Your state now:"
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "turn",
      "label": "discard",
      "when": {
        "calc": "len(players[active_seat - 1].offer) > 1"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "chosen"
      },
      "text": "Choose one of your two cards to discard. Answer with its rank (1 Guard, 2 Priest, 3 Baron, 4 Handmaid, 5 Prince, 6 King, 7 Countess, 8 Princess). Its effect happens at once; you keep the other card."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "turn",
      "label": "resolve discard",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "current_discard",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[active_seat - 1].offer[0]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players[active_seat - 1].offer) == 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "current_discard",
            "value": {
              "calc": "countess_rank if (countess_rank in players[active_seat - 1].hand and (king_rank in players[active_seat - 1].hand or prince_rank in players[active_seat - 1].hand)) else int($chosen)"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players[active_seat - 1].offer) > 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "current_discard"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "discards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "current_discard"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "disc_name",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card_names[current_discard]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "opp_name",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card_names[players[2 - active_seat].hand[0]]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {active_seat} discards {disc_name}."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "guard guess",
      "when": {
        "calc": "current_discard == guard_rank and players[2 - active_seat].protected == 0"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "number",
        "min": {
          "calc": "guard_guess_min"
        },
        "max": {
          "calc": "guard_guess_max"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "guard_guess",
              "value": "$answer"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} names rank {value} with the Guard."
      },
      "text": "Guard: name a rank from {guard_guess_min} to {guard_guess_max}. If your opponent's card has that rank, they are eliminated from the hand; otherwise nothing happens."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "guard check",
      "when": {
        "calc": "guard_guess >= guard_guess_min"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "msg",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card_names[players[2 - active_seat].hand[0]]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "3 - active_seat"
            },
            "key": "eliminated",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[2 - active_seat].hand[0] == guard_guess"
            },
            "text": "Hit: {msg}. Seat {player} is eliminated from the hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "3 - active_seat"
            },
            "to": "out",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[2 - active_seat].eliminated == 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "msg2",
            "value": "Miss",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[2 - active_seat].eliminated == 0"
            },
            "text": "Guard result: Miss. The named rank was wrong."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "priest",
      "when": {
        "calc": "current_discard == priest_rank and players[2 - active_seat].protected == 0"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
      },
      "text": "Priest: your opponent's card is {opp_name}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "baron",
      "when": {
        "calc": "current_discard == baron_rank and players[2 - active_seat].protected == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "msg",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card_names[players[active_seat - 1].hand[0]]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[active_seat - 1].hand[0] < players[2 - active_seat].hand[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "msg",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card_names[players[2 - active_seat].hand[0]]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[2 - active_seat].hand[0] < players[active_seat - 1].hand[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "eliminated",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[active_seat - 1].hand[0] < players[2 - active_seat].hand[0]"
            },
            "text": "Baron: seat {player} has the lower card, {msg}, and is eliminated from the hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "3 - active_seat"
            },
            "key": "eliminated",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[2 - active_seat].hand[0] < players[active_seat - 1].hand[0]"
            },
            "text": "Baron: seat {player} has the lower card, {msg}, and is eliminated from the hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "to": "out",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[active_seat - 1].eliminated == 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "3 - active_seat"
            },
            "to": "out",
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[2 - active_seat].eliminated == 1"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "handmaid",
      "when": {
        "calc": "current_discard == handmaid_rank"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "protected",
            "value": 1,
            "text": "Seat {player} is protected until their next turn starts."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "prince discard",
      "when": {
        "calc": "current_discard == prince_rank"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "prince_target",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(3 - active_seat) if players[2 - active_seat].protected == 0 else active_seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[prince_target - 1].hand[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "msg",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card_names[pick]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "prince_target"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "prince_target"
            },
            "key": "discards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "text": "Prince: seat {player} discards {msg} face up, with no effect."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "prince_target"
            },
            "key": "eliminated",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "pick == princess_rank"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} discarded the Princess and is eliminated from the hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "prince_target"
            },
            "to": "out",
            "if": {
              "calc": "pick == princess_rank"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "prince redraw",
      "when": {
        "calc": "prince_target > 0 and players[prince_target - 1].eliminated == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[0] if len(deck) > 0 else reserve[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "prince_target"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} draws a new card."
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "reserve",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(deck) == 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(deck) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(deck) + len(reserve)"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "king",
      "when": {
        "calc": "current_discard == king_rank and players[2 - active_seat].protected == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[0].hand[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[1].hand"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[pick]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "King: the two players swap hand cards."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "princess",
      "when": {
        "calc": "current_discard == princess_rank"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "eliminated",
            "value": 1,
            "text": "Seat {player} discarded the Princess and is eliminated from the hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "to": "out"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "effect",
      "label": "your hand after effects",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Your state after the effect:"
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "stake",
      "label": "raise",
      "when": {
        "calc": "stake == base_stake and all(p.eliminated == 0 for p in players) and deck_count >= raise_min_deck and len(players[2 - active_seat].discards) >= 1"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "raise",
          "pass"
        ]
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "raised",
              "value": 1,
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer == 'raise'"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} answers: {value}."
      },
      "text": "Raise this hand's stake to 2, or pass? If you raise, your opponent either accepts (the stake becomes {raised_stake}) or folds (you gain {fold_points} point and the hand ends). If you pass, the stake stays {stake}."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "stake",
      "label": "response",
      "when": {
        "calc": "raised == 1"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat != active_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "accept",
          "fold"
        ]
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "stake",
              "value": {
                "calc": "raised_stake"
              },
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer == 'accept'"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "folded",
              "value": 1,
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer == 'fold'"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} answers the raise: {value}."
      },
      "text": "Accept (the stake becomes 2) or fold? If you accept, the hand goes on worth {raised_stake} points. If you fold, your opponent gains {fold_points} point and the hand ends."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "hand end",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "end_kind",
            "value": {
              "calc": "1 if folded == 1 else (2 if any(p.eliminated == 1 for p in players) else (3 if (deck_count <= showdown_deck_threshold or round_number == total_rounds) else 0))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "fold_points"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "end_kind == 1"
            },
            "text": "The raise was folded: seat {player} gains {fold_points} point and the hand ends."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.eliminated == 0"
            },
            "key": "points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "stake"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "end_kind == 2"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} wins the hand and gains {stake}."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "msg",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'Showdown: seat 1 holds ' + card_names[players[0].hand[0]] + ', seat 2 holds ' + card_names[players[1].hand[0]] + '.'"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "end_kind == 3"
            },
            "text": "{msg}"
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.hand[0] > sum(p.hand[0] for p in players) - you.hand[0]"
            },
            "key": "points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "stake"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "end_kind == 3"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} has the higher card and gains {stake}."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "msg2",
            "value": "tie",
            "if": {
              "calc": "end_kind == 3 and players[0].hand[0] == players[1].hand[0]"
            },
            "text": "Equal ranks: nobody scores."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "new_hand",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "end_kind > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "starter_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "3 - starter_seat"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "end_kind > 0"
            },
            "text": "The hand is over. Seat {starter_seat} starts the next hand."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "pass turn",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "active_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starter_seat"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "new_hand == 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "active_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "3 - active_seat"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "new_hand == 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round_number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "after round 40",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number > total_rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number > total_rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.points",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final points: Seat 1 {players[0].points}, Seat 2 {players[1].points}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 40,
    "rounds_max": 40,
    "actions_max": 2000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "Two players, exactly {total_rounds} rounds; one round is one turn by the active player. The deck has {deck_size} cards: {guard_count} Guard (rank {guard_rank}), {priest_count} Priest ({priest_rank}), {baron_count} Baron ({baron_rank}), {handmaid_count} Handmaid ({handmaid_rank}), {prince_count} Prince ({prince_rank}), {king_count} King ({king_rank}), {countess_count} Countess ({countess_rank}), {princess_count} Princess ({princess_rank}). Your hand is seen only by you; discards, points, protection and elimination are public.\n\nNEW HAND: the deck is shuffled, {cards_out_of_play} cards go face up out of play, each player gets {cards_dealt_each} card, leaving {deck_after_deal} in the deck. Discards are emptied, nobody is protected or eliminated, the stake is {base_stake}, and the starter seat (seat {starter_seat} first) takes the first turn. The bottom card of the deck is the reserve: it is never drawn at the start of a turn.\n\nTURN: your protection ends and you draw the top card, so you hold 2. Choose one to discard; it is announced as 'Seat X discards CARD' and its effect happens. If you hold the Countess with a King or a Prince, the Countess is discarded whatever you choose.\n- Guard: if the opponent is not protected, name a rank from {guard_guess_min} to {guard_guess_max} (announced). If the opponent's card has that rank they are eliminated ('Hit: CARD'); otherwise 'Miss' and nothing happens.\n- Priest: if the opponent is not protected, only you are told their card.\n- Baron: if the opponent is not protected, compare hand cards; the lower card's holder is eliminated and that card announced. On equal ranks nothing happens and nothing is revealed.\n- Handmaid: you are protected until your next turn starts.\n- Prince: the opponent, or you if the opponent is protected, discards their hand card face up with no effect (announced). If it is the Princess they are eliminated; otherwise they draw the top card (the reserve only if it is the last card).\n- King: if the opponent is not protected, you swap hand cards.\n- Countess: no effect.\n- Princess: you are eliminated.\nGuard, Priest, Baron and King do nothing when the opponent is protected.\n\nRAISE: when the stake is {base_stake}, nobody is eliminated, at least {raise_min_deck} cards remain and the opponent has at least one discard, you may raise or pass. If you pass, nothing changes. If you raise, the opponent accepts (the stake becomes {raised_stake}) or folds.\n\nHAND END, first that holds: (a) on a fold, the raiser gains {fold_points} point; (b) otherwise, if a player is eliminated, the other gains the stake; (c) otherwise, if {showdown_deck_threshold} or fewer cards remain or it is round {total_rounds}, both cards are revealed and the higher rank gains the stake; equal ranks score nothing. When a hand ends the starter seat switches and the new starter takes the next turn; otherwise the turn passes to the opponent.\n\nAfter round {total_rounds} the player with more points wins; equal points share the win (a draw)."
}
